  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Innovative Financial Inclusion Program, Subprogram 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Subprogram 3 is part of a long-standing Asian Development Bank (ADB) partnership with the Government of Indonesia aimed at building an inclusive finance sector by (i) enhancing tools and infrastructure for financial inclusion, (ii) improving access to financial services for particularly people vulnerable to financial exclusion, and (iii) strengthening the regulatory framework for market conduct supervision and consumer protection.</narrative>
  </description>
